     "text": [
      "\n",
      "====================================================================================================\n",
      "COMPREHENSIVE RESULTS SUMMARY - ALL EXPERIMENTS\n",
      "====================================================================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "====================================================================================================\n",
      "TABLE 1: TEXT CLASSIFICATION RESULTS (AG News Dataset)\n",
      "====================================================================================================\n",
      "             Model Dataset  Accuracy   Loss Parameters  Time (s)                                     Notes\n",
      "       Transformer AG News    0.9066 0.2781    938,500    189.36             Using TransformerEncoderLayer\n",
      "  BiLSTM Attention AG News    0.9118 0.2788    847,557    101.42 Using BiLSTM + Attention mechanism ⭐ BEST\n",
      "LSTM Bidirectional AG News    0.9114 0.2663    624,300     92.85         Standard BiLSTM without attention\n",
      "\n",
      "====================================================================================================\n",
      "TABLE 2: VISION CLASSIFICATION RESULTS (CIFAR-10 Dataset)\n",
      "====================================================================================================\n",
      "       Model  Dataset  Accuracy   Loss Parameters  Time (s)                              Notes\n",
      "   ViT (4x4) CIFAR-10    0.5658 1.2052    280,842    104.25              Patch 4x4, 64 patches\n",
      "CNN Residual CIFAR-10    0.8114 0.5487  2,811,786    156.35 BatchNorm + Residual Blocks ⭐ BEST\n",
      "    DenseNet CIFAR-10    0.7624 0.6853  1,985,432    140.82   Dense connections between layers\n",
      "\n",
      "====================================================================================================\n",
      "TABLE 3: VISION ViT PATCH SIZE EXPERIMENTS (CIFAR-10 Dataset)\n",
      "====================================================================================================\n",
      "Patch Size  Num Patches  Accuracy Parameters  Time (s)\n",
      "       2x2          256    0.5990    300,810    102.80\n",
      "       4x4           64    0.5658    280,842    104.25\n",
      "       8x8           16    0.5247    293,130     49.70\n",
      "\n",
      "====================================================================================================\n",
      "KEY INSIGHTS & ANALYSIS\n",
      "====================================================================================================\n",
      "\n",
      "📊 TEXT CLASSIFICATION FINDINGS:\n",
      "  1. BiLSTM Attention OUTPERFORMS Transformer:\n",
      "     - Accuracy: 0.9118 vs 0.9066 (+0.52%)\n",
      "     - Speed: 1.87× faster (101.42s vs 189.36s)\n",
      "     - Why? AG News texts are SHORT (max 256 tokens)\n",
      "           → Transformer's self-attention overhead not justified\n",
      "           → BiLSTM naturally preserves sequential information\n",
      "     ✓ BEST CHOICE: BiLSTM Attention for short text classification\n",
      "\n",
      "  2. LSTM Bidirectional (without attention) is competitive:\n",
      "     - Accuracy: 0.9114 (nearly same as BiLSTM+Attention)\n",
      "     - Speed: 2.04× faster than Transformer (92.85s)\n",
      "     - Simpler architecture but attention helps marginally\n",
      "\n",
      "🖼️ VISION CLASSIFICATION FINDINGS:\n",
      "  1. CNN Residual DOMINATES Vision Transformers on CIFAR-10:\n",
      "     - Accuracy: 0.8114 vs 0.5658 (+43.4%)\n",
      "     - Reason: CNN inductive bias suits 32×32 images better\n",
      "             → ResNets efficient for small image patches\n",
      "             → ViT designed for large images (≥224×224)\n",
      "     ✓ BEST CHOICE: CNN Residual for CIFAR-10\n",
      "\n",
      "  2. DenseNet competitive but slower:\n",
      "     - Accuracy: 0.7624 (middle ground)\n",
      "     - Speed: 140.82s (slower than CNN despite fewer params)\n",
      "     - Dense connections add computational overhead\n",
      "\n",
      "  3. Patch Size Analysis on ViT:\n",
      "     - 2x2 patches: 0.5990 (best ViT result)\n",
      "     - 4x4 patches: 0.5658 (baseline)\n",
      "     - 8x8 patches: 0.5247 (too coarse)\n",
      "     → Smaller patches capture more detail BUT\n",
      "     → ViT fundamentally struggles with small images\n",
      "\n",
      "💡 GENERAL RECOMMENDATIONS:\n",
      "  ✓ Text Classification (short texts):       BiLSTM + Attention\n",
      "  ✓ Image Classification (32×32):             CNN Residual\n",
      "  ✓ Large-scale images (≥224×224):           Vision Transformer\n",
      "  ✓ Production priority (accuracy):           CNN Residual for CIFAR-10\n",
      "  ✓ Production priority (speed):              BiLSTM for text\n",
      "  ✓ Research/comparison:                      Try ensemble methods\n",
      "\n",
      "====================================================================================================\n",
      "SUMMARY: All results saved to:\n",
      "  - text_results.csv\n",
      "  - vision_results.csv\n",
      "  - patch_size_results.csv\n",
      "  - Visualizations: confusion matrices, loss/accuracy plots\n",
      "====================================================================================================\n",
      "\n"
     ]
    }
