      "3. DEPLOYMENT RECOMMENDATIONS:\n",
      "   - Production (accuracy)  : YOLOv8m  + conf ≥ 0.50\n",
      "   - Edge / realtime        : YOLOv8n  + conf = 0.25\n",
      "   - Safety-critical system : YOLOv8m  + conf ≥ 0.70\n",
      "   - Research / max recall  : YOLOv8s  + conf = 0.10\n",
